0
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
(claps)

0
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.280
- Good God.

0
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.220
- Do you think it's them?

0
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.060
- I wonder.

0
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.280
- Nobody knows we're here except Freida

0
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.480
and she wouldn't ring up.

0
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.680
- It must be them then.

0
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.360
- What are we to do?

0
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.560
- We'll be all right darling.

0
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.220
Whatever happens, aren't we?

0
00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.660
- Now and always, sweet.

0
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.960
- I don't care then.

0
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.400
- It was bound to come sooner or later.

0
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.040
- Hello? Hello? What?

0
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.000
Wrong number.

